# The acid's answer (the fourth acid page, ARP x4): its kind (K1), how often (K2), which way (K3). The line asks, then answers.
seed 0
wait 500
tap GLO
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
expect view 11
spin K1 1
wait 100
expect par151 1
shot answer_page.png
# which way: down
spin K3 1
wait 100
expect par151 5
spin K2 2
wait 100
expect par21 2
wait 9000
